  "description": "Seoyoon meets a named user who impulsively uploads a one-night video on a gay app to give up six years of unrequited love. However, what appeared before my eyes was my older brother Dojin, whom I had a crush on. Do-jin, who has been leading a double life with thorough management, is discovered by Seo-yoon, who confidently says that he wants to be Do-jin's sex partner so as not to miss this opportunity. \"Brother, do you hate having sex with me?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3097001408), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/bnd), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/nextdoor_brother), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000062445), [Peanutoon](https://www.peanutoon.com/ko/comic/detail/11948)",
